# Compiled host test binaries (regenerated by `make`).
#
# Pattern, not a name list: the list missed `test_motion` (an x86-64 ELF was
# committed in #1566) and `test_host_guard`. Every test here is
# `test_<name>.cpp` -> `test_<name>`, so ignore the binaries by shape and keep
# the sources by extension. A new test needs no edit here.
*.o
test_*
!test_*.cpp
!test_*.h
dump_voice_score
